{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2018-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1517443200, "end_date": 1518047999, "month_true_total": 1116, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:57:01 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "39917671", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029615143", "personaname": "unkn0wn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/uxx0/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 114088, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 36, "playtime_at_review": 114051, "last_played": 1789314310, "avatar": "245bf72a4edca6fa17042a9b376eb837f916aa4b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Coming back to this game after a casual 7 year break: Not a lot has changed. There is some attempt at endgame, balancing is just a word, Conclave somehow hangs on and fashion frame reigns supreme as always. So far, I have not had to use recruit chat nor Discord LFGs for anything on merit of difficulty. \"Wide as an ocean, deep as a puddle\" still applies.\n\nI will say that build variety has gotten better, the story is cool (loved 1999 and Duviri) and that content after Rebs takeover has, in a very positive sense, a different feel to it. Most of the new contents grind does not make me hate myself for going for it and then there are Kullervo and Citrine...\n\nThis does not change my opinion of the game needing some kind of endgame challenge. There is simply not much to do anymore after finishing weeklies. As of this review I am LR3, up from MR28 after the 2 months from coming back.\n\n[hr][/hr]\n[i]2019 review:[/i]\n\nhttps://forums.warframe.com/topic/917480-the-temporary-future-of-warframe-trials/\nYou done goofed DE. I'm [i]slightly[/i] salty right now. This single decision is basically a big middle finger to the veteran players face. Can't recommened.\n\nIt just flatlines after a certain point and so far the developers do not seem to be interested in adding actual endgame anytime soon. Which is a shame, because it would have a lot of potential.", "timestamp_created": 1518041050, "timestamp_updated": 1785711344, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 54, "votes_funny": 13, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520150423049926758", "comment_count": 54, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39917653", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065654707", "personaname": "Violatus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/violetblageos/", "num_games_owned": 83, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 139712, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 87710, "last_played": 1763551798, "avatar": "b3877044cdfff2ddb4288f670e0656064d9f1b2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Plz give us our long-waited story quest. After the \"cliff hanger\" prologue we want to know what happened to our space mom :(", "timestamp_created": 1518040966, "timestamp_updated": 1518040966, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39917605", "author": {"steamid": "76561198085613767", "personaname": "InDev", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198085613767/", "num_games_owned": 133, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 132332, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 592, "playtime_at_review": 6702, "last_played": 1788698539, "avatar": "5b8c6669a9d87a337d9b7a1a89fdb3f7f3fb4e43"}, "language": "english", "review": "Epic Game!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Very fun", "timestamp_created": 1518040780, "timestamp_updated": 1518040780, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weig